    "/* Block dragging (the dragger): a grip beside every block, the band over the block in hand, and the\n   seam where it will land. All three are drawn by the editor's own overlay layer, which positions them\n   in document coordinates and rides the scroll — a rendered block in live preview has no line element\n   of its own, so nothing here can hang off `.cm-line`. */",
